From 237f60028477b4bb74888f9366c2b693438e7cc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rkselvam-hub <selvamravik@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 16:00:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] test: fix AES-SIV Wycheproof decrypt-failure vectors

Tag-corruption vectors ran as encrypt tests by default, passing
via a trivial encrypt-side TAG_VALUE_MISMATCH instead of exercising
decrypt-time tag verification.  Set Operation = DECRYPT
and Result = CIPHERUPDATE_ERROR for these stanzas, matching
the actual EVP_CipherUpdate() failure on a bad tag.

Fixes: f11c10d83e95 "Allow 0 length plaintext and aad for aes-siv"
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-sonnet-5
Reviewed-by: Neil Horman <nhorman@openssl.org>
Reviewed-by: Andrew Dinh <andrewd@openssl.org>
Reviewed-by: Eugene Syromiatnikov <esyr@openssl.org>
Merge-date: Sun Nov  8 14:53:24 2026
Merged-from: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/32861
(cherry picked from commit 231c08312cf0c38043f05bb1beb58670abf9b7be)
---
